<title>USA: Clinton hails Smith and Wesson, Master Lock.</title>
<headline>Clinton hails Smith and Wesson, Master Lock.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Clinton Thursday praised a joint effort by Smith and Wesson, the world's largest handgun manufacturer, and Master Lock to protect children from firearms accidents.</p>
<p>The two firms have announced a program to provide a child safety lock with every handgun sold for commercial use. &quot;I applaud both of these companies for their efforts to promote gun safety,&quot; Clinton said in a statement.</p>
<p>&quot;I particularly want to commend Smith and Wesson for taking an important and responsible step for children's safety,&quot; Clinton said. &quot;Child safety locks are the right thing to do.&quot;</p>
</text>
